-----------------------------------------------------------------------------


            Setup commands used in the BBS:SYSTEM/EMULATION
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

CONNECT(n)               (pt)   : NO DEFAULT
                                : connect string sent by modem when a
                                  connection is made.
                                  (n)  is the BAUD rate the system should
                                       accept it as.
                                  (pt) is the string sent by the modem.
                                  
                                  You can force the system to think
                                  a user connecting at 14400, to be running
                                  at 9600, and the other way around.

                                  i.e.  CONNECT%9600  CONNECT 14400/ARQ/V32
